  "prompt_changes": [
    {
      "id": "R1",
      "section": "## EARLY PLANNING CHECKPOINT",
      "problem": "the checkpoint recognises only investigation work, so two disjoint implementation halves are never a candidate; it also gives no property list to assess them by",
      "change": "identifies investigation and implementation work separately, adds the seven assessment properties, adds a coding-delegation candidate list, and keeps the Direct decision valid when coordination would cost more than it saves",
      "before_chars": "2042",
      "after_chars": "4162",
      "before_digest": "sha256:3d10f8cb25d2908d86ba272f6860af4ca6ce857e0c739b9ad9cbceeb717bffbb",
      "after_digest": "sha256:0a4d9567fccade2d82e3adb110457d4f60c6c7ffd8699acc3932330e138eaab6"
    },
    {
      "id": "R2",
      "section": "## DELEGATION CONTRACT",
      "problem": "the contract describes a bounded research task only: nothing says who may write where, that a concurrent batch must not share a writable path, or what an implementation worker returns",
      "change": "adds the implementation-task fields (writable ownership, disjoint paths in one wave, the completion report) without changing any research instruction",
      "before_chars": "1163",
      "after_chars": "1900",
      "before_digest": "sha256:d840af9059b11e2d81e77112ff4f04198bb58a5371e30d5214191d528fa6a2b3",
      "after_digest": "sha256:877dd2c7d4d86e00fc1300856c96d9c034cd7684e09806418c9372ca8ca853be"
    },
    {
      "id": "R3",
      "section": "## HANDOFF-FIRST INTEGRATION",
      "problem": "the handoff section assumes the artefact is findings; after a coding batch it is code in a shared workspace, and the boundary between 'consume the report' and 'verify the change' is not stated",
      "change": "names the code-plus-report artefact, requires the changed files to be read before they are relied on, frees the Main from re-implementing a reviewed module, and keeps verification mandatory",
      "before_chars": "817",
      "after_chars": "1606",
      "before_digest": "sha256:39101df6f649dea49fa9b198dbc75dcaf92b9587d72b320bc3b305823a6309ce",
      "after_digest": "sha256:6979c5cd2ce7f7d03085b332a696def99cc8425f5f06af3976484619fc60c63d"
    }
  ],
